      "review_summary": "The PR parent-scopes provenance-backed Codex fork rows, adds fork-family cache invalidation and regression coverage, refreshes the generated parser hash, and serializes Linux platform-gating tests.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source and corpus level: the linked redacted report identifies 5,427 copied parent events, and committed fixtures exercise unresolved-parent scans. A live after-fix production scan has not been supplied.",
